    the HCPCS code of the connecting components is "E2310",
        confer "electrical and other components to connect the wheelchair controller and power seating system motor (E2310)".
    the connecting components is an accessory of the power wheelchair,
        confer "the sole function of the electrical connection components were to connect the seat elevation feature".
    the connecting components is furnished to the beneficiary,
        confer "four specific power wheelchair accessories furnished to the beneficiary on January 6, 2010".
    the date of service of claim 2 is 2010-01-06,
