    the HCPCS code of the expandable controller is "E2377",
        confer "an expandable controller (E2377)".
    the expandable controller is an accessory of the power wheelchair,
        confer "four specific power wheelchair accessories furnished to the beneficiary on January 6, 2010".
    the expandable controller is furnished to the beneficiary,
        confer "four specific power wheelchair accessories furnished to the beneficiary on January 6, 2010".
    the date of service of claim 3 is 2010-01-06,
        confer "four specific power wheelchair accessories furnished to the beneficiary on January 6, 2010".
    claim 4 is for the harness,
        confer "a power wheelchair harness (E2313)".
    the HCPCS code of the harness is "E2313",
        confer "a power wheelchair harness (E2313)".
    the harness is an accessory of the power wheelchair,
